  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><strong>• About our brand and products:</strong><br>Local Love by Lauren is a female-founded accessories brand focused on elevated everyday essentials with a personalized touch. From custom hair clips and embroidered pouches to beauty tools, every piece is designed to feel special, giftable, and wearable daily. Our products are crafted with high-quality materials like acetate and bamboo, blending style with function.</p><hr style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><strong>• What makes us different:</strong><br>We combine customization, quality, and community. Unlike mass-produced accessories, our pieces are thoughtfully designed and often personalized—whether through embroidery, rhinestones, or curated bundles. Our brand is built on connection and “share the love” moments, making every product feel intentional and meaningful. We also move fast with trends and create limited, highly giftable drops.</p><hr style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><strong>• How affiliates can earn:</strong><br>Affiliates earn commission on every sale through their unique link or code. With strong average order value (bundles + gifting), creators have high earning potential. We also offer opportunities for exclusive codes, seasonal campaigns, and gifting collaborations for top performers.</p><hr style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><strong>• How to promote us:</strong><br>Local Love performs best through authentic, lifestyle-driven content. Think:</p><ul style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><li>“Get ready with me” featuring our clips + brushes</li><li>Packing / travel / daily routine content</li><li>Gift guides (birthdays, bachelorettes, holidays)</li><li>TikTok lives + try-on hauls<br>We encourage creators to show how they<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><em>actually use</em><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>the products—organic integration always converts best.</li></ul><hr style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><strong>• Other information:</strong></p><ul style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><li>Female-owned small business based in Los Angeles</li><li>Fast shipping + strong customer service</li><li>No returns on custom items; store credit offered for others</li><li>Frequent new drops and limited-edition collections</li><li>Open to PR gifting, brand trips, and custom collaborations</li></ul></div></div>",
